                <pb facs="0177" n="165" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv06/pg165"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Opinion of the Drafting Committee as to Certain
                        Modifications Demanded by the Polish Delegation</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Polish Note of May</hi> 30<hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">th</hi>, 1919)</head>
                <p>1. State property (forests, buildings, etc.)</p>
                <p>The Drafting Committee consider that until the definitive assignment to Poland of
                    some Austrian territory, the proposed provision should be reserved.</p>
                <p>2. Division of pre-war debt.</p>
                <p>It appears that the Polish proposal should be submitted to examination by the
                    Economic or Financial Commission.</p>
                <p>3. Financial clauses. Payment of obligations in kronen.</p>
                <p>The Polish proposal falls within the competence of the Financial Commission.</p>
                <closer>For the Drafting Committee.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
